DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuggoolldd driver provides support for PCsensors TEMPer gold devices.  The
     following devices are supported by the uuggoolldd driver:

           _D_e_v_i_c_e                  _S_e_n_s_o_r_s
           RDing TEMPer1V1.2       1 Temperature
           RDing TEMPerV1.4        1 Temperature
           RDing TEMPer1F_V4.1     1 Temperature (external)
           RDing TEMPer2_V4.1      2 Temperature (internal/external)
           RDing TEMPerGold_V3.1   1 Temperature
           RDing TEMPerGold_V3.4   1 Temperature
           RDing TEMPerGold_V3.5   1 Temperature
           RDing TEMPerHum1V1.0    1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerHum1V1.2    1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerHUM_V3.9    1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerHUM_V4.0    1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerHUM_V4.1    1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPer1F_H1V1.5F  1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerX_V3.1      1 Temperature and 1 Humidity
           RDing TEMPerX_V3.3      1 Temperature and 1 Humidity

     The driver possesses a collection of sensor values which are made avail‐
     able through the sysctl(8) interface.

